      "id": "a0",
      "pos": 1,
      "text": "The Reproducibility Project: Psychology attempted replications of 100 studies drawn from three psychology journals.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "pos": 2,
      "text": "Thirty-six percent of the Reproducibility Project: Psychology replications produced statistically significant results in the same direction as the originals.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "pos": 3,
      "text": "Fewer than half of the 100 replications in the Reproducibility Project: Psychology produced significant effects in the original direction.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "pos": 4,
      "text": "At least half of the 100 replications in the Reproducibility Project: Psychology produced significant effects in the original direction.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "pos": 5,
      "text": "Gilbert and colleagues published a commentary in Science in 2016 arguing that infidelities in replication protocols depressed the measured replication rate.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5",
      "pos": 6,
      "text": "Anderson and colleagues replied that the critique depended on unsupported statistical assumptions.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6",
      "pos": 7,
      "text": "Multi-laboratory replication designs estimate between-site heterogeneity to test whether hidden moderators are operating.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7",
      "pos": 8,
      "text": "Many Labs 2 tested 28 published findings in more than 60 laboratories around the world.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8",
      "pos": 9,
      "text": "Many Labs 2 obtained support for 14 of the 28 findings it examined.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9",
      "pos": 10,
      "text": "Many Labs 2 concluded that cultural differences between participant samples accounted for most of the failed replications.",
      "factual": false,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "pos": 11,
      "text": "Some of the original findings that failed to replicate were false positives.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a11",
      "pos": 12,
      "text": "Some replication attempts differed from the original studies in procedural details that affected the outcome.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
